  "description": "A rock. Four spheres, welded into one mesh and voxel-remeshed into a single surface -- which is the step that makes it a rock rather than four spheres inside each other, because the remesh throws away the seams where they met. Then a light cast toward a box for some flat faces, and a displace for the lumps. Cast before displace: the other way round, the cast smooths the lumps straight back off.",
